# DIR and LOAD against a real CompactFlash image. Internal regression check —
# the Storage chapter shows these as typed transcripts, not as a sample file,
# because there is no program to RUN. `console storage` boots with the
# harness's fixture attached, seeded with one file: HELLO.TXT.

console storage
send DIR\r
send LOAD "HELLO.TXT"\r
expect ^READY$
expect HELLO\s*\.TXT
